    {"id":"editorial-manual-218637660-original","group":"editorial-manual-218637660","text":"📺 José Pablo López propondrá al Consejo de RTVE que España siga fuera de Eurovisión en 2027 mientras Israel continúe en el certamen. La decisión final corresponde al Consejo.","buttons":[[{"label":"PUBLICAR ORIGINAL","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%93%BA%20Jos%C3%A9%20Pablo%20L%C3%B3pez%20propondr%C3%A1%20al%20Consejo%20de%20RTVE%20que%20Espa%C3%B1a%20siga%20fuera%20de%20Eurovisi%C3%B3n%20en%202027%20mientras%20Israel%20contin%C3%BAe%20en%20el%20certamen.%20La%20decisi%C3%B3n%20final%20corresponde%20al%20Consejo."}]]},
    {"id":"editorial-manual-218637660-a","group":"editorial-manual-218637660","text":"🌶️ A) Eurovisión 2027: España ya tiene propuesta de canción. Se titula «No voy».","buttons":[[{"label":"PUBLICAR A","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%93%BA%20Jos%C3%A9%20Pablo%20L%C3%B3pez%20propondr%C3%A1%20al%20Consejo%20de%20RTVE%20que%20Espa%C3%B1a%20siga%20fuera%20de%20Eurovisi%C3%B3n%20en%202027%20mientras%20Israel%20contin%C3%BAe%20en%20el%20certamen.%20La%20decisi%C3%B3n%20final%20corresponde%20al%20Consejo.%20%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Eurovisi%C3%B3n%202027%3A%20Espa%C3%B1a%20ya%20tiene%20propuesta%20de%20canci%C3%B3n.%20Se%20titula%20%C2%ABNo%20voy%C2%BB."}]]},
    {"id":"editorial-manual-218637660-b","group":"editorial-manual-218637660","text":"🌶️ B) RTVE vuelve a poner el «Europe» de Eurovisión en modo avión.","buttons":[[{"label":"PUBLICAR B","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%93%BA%20Jos%C3%A9%20Pablo%20L%C3%B3pez%20propondr%C3%A1%20al%20Consejo%20de%20RTVE%20que%20Espa%C3%B1a%20siga%20fuera%20de%20Eurovisi%C3%B3n%20en%202027%20mientras%20Israel%20contin%C3%BAe%20en%20el%20certamen.%20La%20decisi%C3%B3n%20final%20corresponde%20al%20Consejo.%20%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20RTVE%20vuelve%20a%20poner%20el%20%C2%ABEurope%C2%BB%20de%20Eurovisi%C3%B3n%20en%20modo%20avi%C3%B3n."}]]},
    {"id":"editorial-manual-218637660-c","group":"editorial-manual-218637660","text":"🌶️ C) España podría repetir en 2027 su actuación más difícil: no presentarse.","buttons":[[{"label":"PUBLICAR C","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%93%BA%20Jos%C3%A9%20Pablo%20L%C3%B3pez%20propondr%C3%A1%20al%20Consejo%20de%20RTVE%20que%20Espa%C3%B1a%20siga%20fuera%20de%20Eurovisi%C3%B3n%20en%202027%20mientras%20Israel%20contin%C3%BAe%20en%20el%20certamen.%20La%20decisi%C3%B3n%20final%20corresponde%20al%20Consejo.%20%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Espa%C3%B1a%20podr%C3%ADa%20repetir%20en%202027%20su%20actuaci%C3%B3n%20m%C3%A1s%20dif%C3%ADcil%3A%20no%20presentarse."}]]},
    {"id":"editorial-6a8fc2db25a6-original","group":"editorial-6a8fc2db25a6","text":"🏛️ La Fiscalía pide dos años y medio de inhabilitación para la alcaldesa de Alcalá de Henares, Judith Piquet, por presunta revelación de secretos al difundir un informe policial reservado.","buttons":[[{"label":"PUBLICAR ORIGINAL","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8F%9B%EF%B8%8F%20La%20Fiscal%C3%ADa%20pide%20dos%20a%C3%B1os%20y%20medio%20de%20inhabilitaci%C3%B3n%20para%20la%20alcaldesa%20de%20Alcal%C3%A1%20de%20Henares%2C%20Judith%20Piquet%2C%20por%20presunta%20revelaci%C3%B3n%20de%20secretos%20al%20difundir%20un%20informe%20policial%20reservado."}]]},
    {"id":"editorial-6a8fc2db25a6-a","group":"editorial-6a8fc2db25a6","text":"🌶️ A) El informe era reservado hasta que descubrió su vocación de hilo de X.","buttons":[[{"label":"PUBLICAR A","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8F%9B%EF%B8%8F%20La%20Fiscal%C3%ADa%20pide%20dos%20a%C3%B1os%20y%20medio%20de%20inhabilitaci%C3%B3n%20para%20la%20alcaldesa%20de%20Alcal%C3%A1%20de%20Henares%2C%20Judith%20Piquet%2C%20por%20presunta%20revelaci%C3%B3n%20de%20secretos%20al%20difundir%20un%20informe%20policial%20reservado.%20%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20El%20informe%20era%20reservado%20hasta%20que%20descubri%C3%B3%20su%20vocaci%C3%B3n%20de%20hilo%20de%20X."}]]},
    {"id":"editorial-6a8fc2db25a6-b","group":"editorial-6a8fc2db25a6","text":"🌶️ B) La Fiscalía también ha puesto el documento en modo «solo lectura».","buttons":[[{"label":"PUBLICAR B","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8F%9B%EF%B8%8F%20La%20Fiscal%C3%ADa%20pide%20dos%20a%C3%B1os%20y%20medio%20de%20inhabilitaci%C3%B3n%20para%20la%20alcaldesa%20de%20Alcal%C3%A1%20de%20Henares%2C%20Judith%20Piquet%2C%20por%20presunta%20revelaci%C3%B3n%20de%20secretos%20al%20difundir%20un%20informe%20policial%20reservado.%20%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20La%20Fiscal%C3%ADa%20tambi%C3%A9n%20ha%20puesto%20el%20documento%20en%20modo%20%C2%ABsolo%20lectura%C2%BB."}]]},
    {"id":"editorial-6a8fc2db25a6-c","group":"editorial-6a8fc2db25a6","text":"🌶️ C) «Reservado» era, al parecer, una sugerencia de formato.","buttons":[[{"label":"PUBLICAR C","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8F%9B%EF%B8%8F%20La%20Fiscal%C3%ADa%20pide%20dos%20a%C3%B1os%20y%20medio%20de%20inhabilitaci%C3%B3n%20para%20la%20alcaldesa%20de%20Alcal%C3%A1%20de%20Henares%2C%20Judith%20Piquet%2C%20por%20presunta%20revelaci%C3%B3n%20de%20secretos%20al%20difundir%20un%20informe%20policial%20reservado.%20%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20%C2%ABReservado%C2%BB%20era%2C%20al%20parecer%2C%20una%20sugerencia%20de%20formato."}]]}
